{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110524001:1":{"text":"얼른 진찰 좀 해주세요... 제발.","source_cn":"快些检查吧……拜托了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x118461DF697A5842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110524002:1":{"text":"음... 아르사의 증상과 칼에 남아있는 독약의 색깔로 봤을 때...","source_cn":"唔……从阿尔萨的症状和匕首上残余毒药的色泽判断——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69846B180376688F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110524003:1":{"text":"틀림없어. 이건 내가 찾던 독약이야.","source_cn":"错不了，确实是我想的那种毒药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C4B76D8A5067BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110524004:1":{"text":"이봐요! 죄를 뉘우칠 기회를 주려고 데려온 거니, 뜸 들이지 말고 얼른 말해요! 해독제를 조제할 수 있어요?","source_cn":"喂！你在将功补过，别卖关子了！你能配出解药吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92EE7E2B88025EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110524005:1":{"text":"가능하기도, 불가능하기도 해.","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110524005":{"text":"가능하기도, 불가능하기도 해.","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110524006:1":{"text":"윽! 눈에 아주 살기가 넘치네! 왜 그러냐면...","source_cn":"呃！你们的眼神不要这么恐怖！是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD134460D09CABEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110524007:1":{"text":"해독제 레시피는 대충 내 머릿속에 있는데, 여기에 가장 중요한 약초가 하나 없어.","source_cn":"解药的配方我大致有头绪，不过缺少了一种关键的草药！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5FC899A5FB3739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110524008:1":{"text":"그 약초의 이름은 빛나는 모래 풀인데, 약초를 얻을 수 있는 곳은 단 한 곳뿐이야. 그게 어디게?","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110524008":{"text":"그 약초의 이름은 빛나는 모래 풀인데, 약초를 얻을 수 있는 곳은 단 한 곳뿐이야. 그게 어디게?","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110524009:1":{"text":"지, 진짜 일부러 그런 거 아니야! 에휴, 자기 전에 아이들한테 동화책을 읽어 주는 게 습관이 돼서 그만!","source_cn":"我、我真的不是有意的！唉，都是给孩子们讲太多睡前故事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2DC4D36708206AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110524010:1":{"text":"내가 아는 약초상 중에 이런 약초를 취급하는 상인은 벤키 밖에 없어. 석양 전투장에 가면 벤키를 만날 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"我只认识一个草药商——班吉能提供这种草药，他平时在残阳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC953FA149DC45FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110524011:1":{"text":"군가 축제의 막사에서 석양 전투장까지 가야 한다고요? 여기에 올 때처럼 블랙하울의 영지로 돌아가면 분명 늦을 거예요...","source_cn":"从战歌营帐去残阳武斗场？如果像来的时候那样从黑嚎营地绕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8449FE7225F55C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110524012:1":{"text":"사람 목숨이 달린 일인데, 잠시도 지체하면 안 되죠. 돌아갈 필요 없어요, 소렌…","source_cn":"人命关天，片刻都不能耽误。不必绕路了，索恩……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCD2F333F1F47FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110524013:0":{"text":"제가 전투장 후문으로 바로 통과할 수 있게 친필 편지를 써드리죠!","source_cn":"我会给你们一份手书，让你们可以从武斗场的后门通过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC49486FBFD7D80A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"통행증","source_cn":"通行证","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30A7DBB9E6C040D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110524014:1":{"text":"칼라... 고마워!","source_cn":"曼卡拉……多谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67DF0A250318EC03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110524015:1":{"text":"얼른 출발해요. 저는 여기서 아르사를 돌볼게요.","source_cn":"快出发吧，我跟这个家伙帮你照顾阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1325F06813153A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110524016:1":{"text":"최대한 빨리 돌아올 테니까, 아르사를 부탁해!","source_cn":"拜托了！我会尽快返回的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69141694B12D0B9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110524017:1":{"text":"최선을 다해 아르사를 보살피세요. 아르사에게 무슨 문제라도 생긴다면...","source_cn":"好好照顾阿尔萨，如果阿尔萨出了什么问题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA10E12E44FFFCEAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110524018:1":{"text":"에? 그게 왜 내 책임이야?","source_cn":"诶？怎么就成了我的责任？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9807B5DEC7FD2FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"얼른 말해!","source_cn":"快说！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D50EC59DC57970B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얼른 말해!","female":"얼른 말해!","variant_male_record_index":"63126","variant_female_record_index":"63127","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"또 뜸 들이네?","source_cn":"……又卖关子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7700A6FD8A03A046","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 뜸 들이네?","female":"또 뜸 들이네?","variant_male_record_index":"63128","variant_female_record_index":"63129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"어떻게 가능한데?","source_cn":"为什么能？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC330C851A63E8A61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떻게 가능한데?","female":"어떻게 가능한데?","variant_male_record_index":"63122","variant_female_record_index":"63123","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"왜 불가능한데?","source_cn":"为什么不能？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE32433B98969CFBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왜 불가능한데?","female":"왜 불가능한데?","variant_male_record_index":"63124","variant_female_record_index":"63125","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"스모키","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":3}}